Z||000000||overlord||03-28-2000||07:32 PM||||just finished completing my boxes for my subs...hooked em up to my stereo in my room and OMG!<P>they shake the walls, upstairs and down..-)<BR>and thats before the amp, crossover and bridging!!<P>just hope the fieros windows can handle the bss now!!   teehhee...just so damned giddy!!<P>speaking of subs...<P>anyone know what exactly BRIDGING is??<BR>thanx.||||reg||10
